msgid ""
"When ``PyEval_GetLocals()`` is being used as an equivalent to calling ``sys."
"_getframe().f_locals`` in Python, it should be replaced by calling "
"``PyFrame_GetLocals()`` on the result of ``PyEval_GetFrame()``."
msgstr ""

